        {
          "title": "Start a new chat",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>In <strong>Chats</strong>, tap the speech bubble next to <strong>Channels</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/619a6bdf699bf873.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2842
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "New message",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p><strong>New message</strong> opens. Tap the <strong>Name or callsign</strong> field.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/0eb5c8462249cd4b.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2842
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Find them",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Type their name or callsign, then tap them.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/da3346b181e61af6.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2842
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Write to them",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Your direct chat with them opens. Write as in any chat.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/37d53bd463f57e51.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2842
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Start from the map",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>You can also start from the map. Tap their marker, then the speech bubble on the ring around it.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/12abdefbca3341fc.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2842
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "The same chat opens",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>The same direct chat opens. The speech bubble on their row in ATAK's contacts opens it too.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/58578a40401de176.webp",
